# 行尾统一：文本文件在仓库内一律存 LF，避免 Windows 编辑器把 CRLF 带进提交
# （1.17.0 提交前曾出现 build.gradle 等 11 个文件被整体转成 CRLF，产生 1500 行虚假 diff）
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做行尾转换
*.jar binary
*.zip binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary

# Windows 批处理必须保留 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
